#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit C API {#install-the-qiskit-c-api}"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit C API {#install-the-qiskit-c-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to install and use the Qiskit C API. To see how to extend your\n"
"Qiskit Python workflow with C, read [Extend Python with the Qiskit C API](/guides/c-extension-for-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menerangkan cara memasang dan menggunakan Qiskit C API. Untuk "
"tahu cara melanjutkan aliran kerja Python Qiskit anda dengan C, baca "
"[Lanjutkan Python dengan Qiskit C API](/guides/c-extension-for-python).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following example builds an observable with C:\n"
msgstr "Contoh berikut membina observable menggunakan C:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "UNIX-like {#unix-like}"
msgstr "UNIX-like {#unix-like}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides build instructions for UNIX-like systems.\n"
msgstr "Bahagian ini menyediakan arahan binaan untuk sistem UNIX-like.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Keperluan {#requirements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compilation requires the following tools:\n"
"* A Rust compiler: see for example the [guide on installing Qiskit from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"* A C compiler: for example, GCC on Linux and Clang on MacOS. Qiskit's C API is compatible with a compiler conforming to the [C11](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C11_(C_standard_revision)) standard.\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): a tool to create the C header, which you can install with `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"    Note that running the tool from the command line should be enabled, which might require exporting your `PATH` variable to include `/path/to/.cargo/bin`\n"
"* Python library installed (Python 3.9+): The Python library is required during dynamic linking. Notice that Python is not used at runtime and the interpreter is never initialized; only some symbols from `libpython` need to be defined. See [this issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14240) for more details\n"
"* (GNU) Make: this is optional but is recommended to use automated install processes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penyusunan memerlukan alat-alat berikut:\n"
"* Pengkompil Rust: lihat contohnya [panduan memasang Qiskit dari sumber](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"* Pengkompil C: contohnya, GCC di Linux dan Clang di MacOS. C API Qiskit serasi dengan pengkompil yang mematuhi piawaian [C11](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C11_(C_standard_revision)).\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): alat untuk mencipta pengepala C, yang boleh anda pasang dengan `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"    Perhatikan bahawa menjalankan alat dari baris perintah perlu diaktifkan, yang mungkin memerlukan mengeksport pemboleh ubah `PATH` anda untuk menyertakan `/path/to/.cargo/bin`\n"
"* Pustaka Python dipasang (Python 3.9+): Pustaka Python diperlukan semasa penghubungan dinamik. Perlu diingat bahawa Python tidak digunakan semasa runtime dan penterjemah tidak pernah dimulakan; hanya beberapa simbol dari `libpython` perlu ditakrifkan. Lihat [isu ini](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14240) untuk maklumat lanjut\n"
"* (GNU) Make: ini pilihan tetapi disyorkan untuk menggunakan proses pemasangan automatik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This code verifies that everything has been installed:\n"
msgstr "Kod ini mengesahkan bahawa semua telah dipasang:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build {#build}"
msgstr "Binaan {#build}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To build the C header and library, you can run the following Make "
"command[^1] in Qiskit root,\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk membina pengepala C dan pustaka, anda boleh menjalankan arahan Make "
"berikut[^1] di direktori akar Qiskit,\n"

#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[^1]: If you did not install Make, check the `Makefile` in Qiskit root for "
"the required commands - or simply install Make; it's not too late."
msgstr ""
"[^1]: Jika anda tidak memasang Make, semak `Makefile` di direktori akar "
"Qiskit untuk arahan yang diperlukan - atau pasang sahaja Make; masih belum "
"terlambat.)"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"which will provide the compiled shared library in `dist/c/lib` and the `qiskit.h` header with\n"
"all function declarations in `dist/c/include`. Note that the precise library name depends\n"
"on the platform; for example,`libqiskit.so` on UNIX and `libqiskit.dylib` on MacOS.\n"
"(Note that this step currently emits a lot of warnings, which is expected, and is no cause for alarm. Future versions will remove the warnings.)\n"
msgstr ""
"yang akan menyediakan pustaka kongsi yang telah dikompil di `dist/c/lib` dan pengepala `qiskit.h` dengan semua deklarasi fungsi di `dist/c/include`. Perhatikan bahawa nama pustaka yang tepat bergantung pada platform; contohnya, `libqiskit.so` di UNIX dan `libqiskit.dylib` di MacOS.\n"
"(Perhatikan bahawa langkah ini pada masa ini mengeluarkan banyak amaran, yang dijangka, dan tidak perlu dibimbangkan. Versi masa depan akan menghapuskan amaran tersebut.)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can then compile a C program using the Qiskit C header and library:\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda kemudian boleh mengkompil program C menggunakan pengepala dan pustaka C"
" Qiskit:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ensure the Qiskit library is found during linking, set the runtime library path to\n"
"include `/path/to/dist/c/lib`. If the Python library is not available per default during dynamic linking,\n"
"this also needs to be added. These commands depend on the platform. On Linux:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memastikan pustaka Qiskit dijumpai semasa penghubungan, tetapkan "
"laluan pustaka runtime untuk menyertakan `/path/to/dist/c/lib`. Jika pustaka"
" Python tidak tersedia secara lalai semasa penghubungan dinamik, ini juga "
"perlu ditambah. Arahan ini bergantung pada platform. Di Linux:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "On MacOS:\n"
msgstr "Di MacOS:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can set the runtime library path during compilation by "
"adding\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai alternatif, anda boleh menetapkan laluan pustaka runtime semasa "
"penyusunan dengan menambah\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"to the compiler flags.\n"
"In addition, the Python library needs to be available during dynamic linking. In Linux environments\n"
"this is typically the default. \n"
msgstr ""
"pada bendera pengkompil.\n"
"Selain itu, pustaka Python perlu tersedia semasa penghubungan dinamik. Di persekitaran Linux ini biasanya sudah menjadi lalai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Now you can execute the binary:\n"
msgstr "Sekarang anda boleh melaksanakan binari:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "which, if using the example snippet shown previously, should print\n"
msgstr ""
"yang, jika menggunakan petikan contoh yang ditunjukkan sebelum ini, "
"sepatutnya mencetak\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Windows {#windows}"
msgstr "Windows {#windows}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides build instructions for Windows systems.\n"
msgstr "Bahagian ini menyediakan arahan binaan untuk sistem Windows.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements-1}"
msgstr "Keperluan {#requirements-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compilation requires the following tools:\n"
"* A Rust compiler: see for example the [guide on installing Qiskit from source](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#installing-qiskit-from-source)\n"
"* A C compiler: for example, MSVC and the native command prompt offering the ``cl`` command\n"
"* A Python installation, with access to both ``python3.lib`` and ``python3.dll``\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): a tool to create the C header, which you can install with `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"    Note that running the tool from the command line should be enabled, which might require updating your `PATH` variable to include the cargo path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penyusunan memerlukan alat-alat berikut:\n"
"* Pengkompil Rust: lihat contohnya [panduan memasang Qiskit dari sumber](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#installing-qiskit-from-source)\n"
"* Pengkompil C: contohnya, MSVC dan command prompt natif yang menawarkan arahan ``cl``\n"
"* Pemasangan Python, dengan akses kepada ``python3.lib`` dan ``python3.dll``\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): alat untuk mencipta pengepala C, yang boleh anda pasang dengan `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"    Perhatikan bahawa menjalankan alat dari baris perintah perlu diaktifkan, yang mungkin memerlukan mengemaskini pemboleh ubah `PATH` anda untuk menyertakan laluan cargo.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build {#build-1}"
msgstr "Binaan {#build-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, compile the `qiskit_cext` dynamic library, by running the following "
"in Qiskit root\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, kompil pustaka dinamik `qiskit_cext`, dengan menjalankan arahan "
"berikut di direktori akar Qiskit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This will generate the ``.dll`` dynamic library and associated ``.dll.lib`` file in `target/release`.\n"
"Next, generate the header with\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini akan menjana pustaka dinamik ``.dll`` dan fail ``.dll.lib`` yang berkaitan di `target/release`.\n"
"Seterusnya, jana pengepala dengan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This will write the MSVC-compatible header in ``dist\\c\\include``.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini akan menulis pengepala yang serasi dengan MSVC di "
"``dist\\c\\include``.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now you can use `cl` to compile the C program. To ensure the compiler finds the qiskit library,\n"
"we include `target\\release` in the `PATH` variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang anda boleh menggunakan `cl` untuk mengkompil program C. Untuk "
"memastikan pengkompil menjumpai pustaka qiskit, kita sertakan "
"`target\\release` dalam pemboleh ubah `PATH`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before running, you have to include the path to your ``python3.dll``.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum menjalankan, anda perlu menyertakan laluan ke ``python3.dll`` "
"anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "should then print\n"
msgstr "sepatutnya mencetak\n"
